                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today on Sh*t That Ain\u2019t True. \nTrump and Republicans\u2019 \u201cBorn Alive Bill\u201d isn\u2019t about protecting anyone \u2014 it\u2019s about taking away the freedom of patients to make their most personal and difficult medical decisions with their doctor. \n \nThe reality is this bill would strip away the dignity of mothers and infants during their most heart-wrenching final moments together. \n\nNo wonder numerous groups representing doctors and healthcare providers (like the American Medical Association) are opposed to this bill.",
