                "text": "From a doctor in Maryland who specializes in public health and infectious diseases:\n\n\"People travel across the country to participate in these trials, some lifesaving trials. The pause doesn\u2019t just impact the researcher, their work, their livelihoods; it impacts the patients themselves, potentially life-threatening impacts.\"",
