                "text": "Americans are clear: they want lower prices and an economy that works for them. Instead, President Trump and Elon Musk are creating crisis after crisis across our communities \u2014 hurting everything from healthcare and hospitals, to farmers, to nuclear security \u2014 all to make room for a tax cut for billionaires.",
